SUMMARY:Gay Pride of Portland Pageant
DESCRIPTION:Established in 2000\, the Gay Pride of Portland Pageant has been an opportunity for the LGBTQIA2S+ community to represent PRIDE in our city of Portland. This year’s theme “Force of Nature” challenges applicants to develop competitive drag based performances that center their Pride. This event will crown this year’s Pride representatives. This event is an annual fundraising event for Pride Northwest.
