SUMMARY:Sharksploration with Big Fish LabShark Presentation & Dissection
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a shark exhibit\, a presentation and an in-person shark dissection at Crystal Ballroom and Lola’s Room – all courtesy of Oregon State University’s Big Fish Lab. Don’t miss out on this incredible opportunity to meet Oregon’s shark scientists and learn about the important work they do. And we’ll be projecting the dissection onto the big screen\, so you won’t miss any of the details. \nOur recommendation: Hit up Ringlers Pub or Hal’s Café for dinner before the presentation\, then peruse the shark exhibits in Lola’s Room before getting your seat for the big show! \nThe DetailsShark exhibits * Lola’s Room * Opens at 6pmPresentation * Crystal Ballroom * 6pm doors\, 7pm startShark dissection * Crystal Ballroom * 8pm \nPlease note: Crystal Ballroom has very limited food options\, but Ringlers Pub and Hal’s Café – both located just steps from the venue – will be open and serving their full menus.
URL:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/277066-sharksploration-with-big-fish-labbrshark-presentation-dissection/
CATEGORIES:July
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Shark_eye-ymEsiq.tmp_.jpg
END:VEVENT
